b) remove, switch off or work around the licence check, or help others to do so;
c) remove or change the copyright and licence notices in the Software;
d) offer the Software to third parties as a hosted or managed forum service of
   your own without the Vendor's written permission;
e) use the names "Divan" and "Web Danışmanı" or their logos for a product or
   service of your own, other than to say truthfully that your forum runs on the
   Software.


